      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "The prayer in the present petition under Section 482 Cr.P.C. is for quashing of FIR No.351 dated 09.11.2004 under Sections 420, 465, 467, 468, 471 and 120-B IPC registered at Police Station Civil Lines, Amritsar alongwith all subsequent proceedings arising therefrom on the basis of compromise (P-2).\nThe learned counsel for the petitioner while relying on the order passed by the Hon'ble Supreme Court dated 28.08.2006 contends that the matter had been settled and the statement of the counsel Salwinder Singh And Anr vs State Of Punjab And Another on 18 August, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/159291856/\n1 for the complainant had been recorded that he had received the full amount.",
