      "end": 1395,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "None appears on behalf of the respondent No.2.\n1 of 2 Neutral Citation No:=2023:PHHC:107565 2023:PHHC:107565 CRM-M-42702-2021 (O & M)\n::2::-\nThe learned counsel for the State, on the other hand, contends that there is no reference in the aforesaid order that a quashing petition based on a compromise would be filed.\nFaced with this situation, the learned counsel for the petitioner submits that he wishes to withdraw the present petition.\nIn view of the above, the present petition is ordered to be dismissed as withdrawn.",
